The agent skills in this directory are vendored, unmodified, from six upstream
sources (versions and hashes in skills-lock.json at the repository root). None
is covered by the repository's proprietary LICENSE. Sources 1-4 and 6 are MIT;
source 5 is Apache-2.0 and ships its own licence text.

1. architect, audit, check, debug, develop, document, scope, sync, test
   Source: <https://github.com/jsmastery-pro/skills>
   Revision: 43b69e44c9ca905fe3a3418ccdf4102255e20d40
   License: MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 JavaScript Mastery

2. clerk, clerk-backend-api, clerk-cli, clerk-custom-ui, clerk-nextjs-patterns,
   clerk-orgs, clerk-setup, clerk-webhooks
   Source: <https://github.com/clerk/skills>
   Revision: a02dbd2a933b8929525129a6cb9dcf6ed66d0adf
   License: MIT, Copyright (c) Clerk (as stated in the upstream README,
   plugin.json and each skill's SKILL.md frontmatter)

3. better-accessibility, better-colors, better-interface, better-layout,
   better-typography, better-ui, better-writing, break, build-design,
   explain-interface, interface-review, state-machine, variant
   Source: <https://github.com/jakubkrehel/skills>
   Revision: d574cc8a576dc24256ad38268b8d03d86724a1b3
   License: MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Jakub Krehel

4. ask-matt, code-review, codebase-design, diagnosing-bugs, domain-modeling,
   grill-me, grill-with-docs, grilling, handoff, implement, implement-spec,
   improve-codebase-architecture, pr, prototype, research, retro,
   setup-matt-pocock-skills, tdd, teach, to-questionnaire, to-spec,
   to-tickets, triage, wait-what, wayfinder, wizard, writing-for-agents
   Source: <https://github.com/mattpocock/skills>
   Revision: b0618bc436ad893b3c5e84e55fba86586d34a404
   License: MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Matt Pocock

5. frontend-design
   Source: <https://github.com/anthropics/skills> (skills/frontend-design)
   Revision: 683bc88e56f3e09ba94f7055977f3d3aa499f202
   License: Apache License 2.0; full text in frontend-design/LICENSE.txt
   (copied unmodified from upstream, as the skill's frontmatter directs)

6. supabase, supabase-postgres-best-practices
   Source: <https://github.com/supabase/agent-skills>
   Revision: c9be0e931b7930f7d02126d04774d904c381e7d7
   License: MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Supabase

